    <panel_attributes>*Step 1: Cs discharge     (S3, S2, S1) = (Closed, Opened, Closed)*
*Step 2: Dead-time        (S3, S2, S1) = (Opened, Opened, Opened)*
*Step 3: Cx Charge cycle  (S3, S2, S1) = (Opened, Closed, Opened)*
*Step 4: Dead-time        (S3, S2, S1) = (Opened, Opened, Opened)*
*Step 5: Charge transferred to Cs (S3, S2, S1) = (Opened, Opened, Closed)*
*Step 6: Dead-time        (S3, S2, S1) = (Opened, Opened, Opened)*
*Step 7: Cx discharge     (S3, S2, S1) = (Closed, Opened, Closed)*

*ps. repeat step 3 ~ step 6 until V_Cs get target value*
fontsize=16
fg=BLUE</panel_attributes>
